    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strangers Lurk is a next gen horror experience played from the POV of a bodycam as you try to survive a night of being stalked and taunted by a unknown masked stranger.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580210/extras/07d16ce51b8ed6d57c93fcf0f999dc18.avif?t=1745176296\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Story</strong><i>:</i><br><br><i>Play as Erica who works as a nanny for insurance purposes she is required to wear a bodycam while sitting for people. Its a friday night and the neighbors down the road had their sitter cancel last minute and asked you if you could come instead. What starts as a normal nights baby sitting becomes a chilling fight for survival as a masked maniac taunts you. Will you survive the night? Or will you become another victim of this deranged masked stranger. </i>  <br>  <br><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong>  <br>  <br><strong>Multiple areas to explore: </strong> <br>Set across 2 levels with\u00a0multiple houses to explore with where danger lurks at every turn!<br>   <br><strong>Realistic Environment:\u00a0  </strong>  <br>This game is built with Unreal Engine 5 to create a terrifying realistic home invasion experience.    <br>   <br><strong>Jump Scares </strong> <br><strong> </strong>A masked maniac on the loose and dark corners everywhere your every move should be considered or it could be your last!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strangers Lurk is a next gen horror experience played from the POV of a bodycam as you try to survive a night of being stalked and taunted by a unknown masked stranger.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580210/extras/07d16ce51b8ed6d57c93fcf0f999dc18.avif?t=1745176296\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Story</strong><i>:</i><br><br><i>Play as Erica who works as a nanny for insurance purposes she is required to wear a bodycam while sitting for people. Its a friday night and the neighbors down the road had their sitter cancel last minute and asked you if you could come instead. What starts as a normal nights baby sitting becomes a chilling fight for survival as a masked maniac taunts you. Will you survive the night? Or will you become another victim of this deranged masked stranger. </i>  <br>  <br><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong>  <br>  <br><strong>Multiple areas to explore: </strong> <br>Set across 2 levels with\u00a0multiple houses to explore with where danger lurks at every turn!<br>   <br><strong>Realistic Environment:\u00a0  </strong>  <br>This game is built with Unreal Engine 5 to create a terrifying realistic home invasion experience.    <br>   <br><strong>Jump Scares </strong> <br><strong> </strong>A masked maniac on the loose and dark corners everywhere your every move should be considered or it could be your last!</p>",
    "short_description": "What starts as strange phone calls from a unknown stranger who sometimes just breaths, Eerie creeks and sounds through out the house soon turns into a deadly game of cat and mouse. The calls might just be coming from INSIDE the house!",
